WEBVTT

00:10.650 --> 00:11.900
Here it comes, everyone!

00:26.850 --> 00:29.070
Mythril Golems sure are tough.

00:29.070 --> 00:29.840
In that case...

00:30.280 --> 00:31.300
Everyone, get back!

00:31.300 --> 00:33.270
There's something I want to try!

00:37.160 --> 00:38.140
Gate!

00:42.000 --> 00:44.720
T-Touya?! What did you do?

00:44.720 --> 00:47.660
Well, I used Gate to teleport them.

00:49.230 --> 00:52.690
All the way into the sky 
10,000 meters above us.

00:59.630 --> 01:00.620
Over there, huh?

01:09.910 --> 01:10.740
Let's go!

01:10.740 --> 01:11.550
Yeah!

01:12.980 --> 01:14.110
Accel!

01:24.970 --> 01:26.310
Come forth, Water!

01:26.310 --> 01:29.120
Ballistic Bubbles: Bubble Bomb!

01:36.920 --> 01:39.390
Accel, Boost!

01:47.870 --> 01:49.450
Strike forth, Lightning!

01:49.450 --> 01:52.680
Spear of a Hundred Thunderclaps: 
Lightning Javelin!

02:12.980 --> 02:15.970
That completes our quest.

03:47.990 --> 03:53.000
Chapter 1

03:47.990 --> 03:53.000
Engagement Rings and a Hot Spring

03:57.770 --> 03:58.930
Hup.

03:59.340 --> 04:01.040
Oh! Tou—

04:01.040 --> 04:02.660
Sir Touya!

04:02.660 --> 04:05.140
Welcome back, Sir Touya.

04:05.530 --> 04:07.690
I'm home, Renne, Cecil-san.

04:07.690 --> 04:09.720
Did you defeat the Mythril Golems?

04:09.720 --> 04:10.450
Yeah.

04:10.450 --> 04:12.500
Then you earned the Red rank?

04:12.500 --> 04:16.070
I did. Yumina's now Blue, 
and the rest of us are Red.

04:17.440 --> 04:21.230
Now we're all considered 
first-rate adventurers.

04:21.230 --> 04:24.450
Sir Touya, I've prepared the bath for you.

04:24.450 --> 04:26.860
Thank you. Then everyone else can go first.

04:26.860 --> 04:27.880
Huh?

04:28.910 --> 04:30.540
Where's Miss Cesca?

04:31.640 --> 04:32.440
Oh...

04:36.600 --> 04:38.130
I forgot her...

04:41.910 --> 04:44.550
It does not bother me at all.

04:44.550 --> 04:46.510
I do not mind one bit

04:46.510 --> 04:49.760
that you left me behind and 
quickly returned home, Master.

04:49.760 --> 04:52.240
No, not one bit.

04:55.000 --> 05:00.570
Thanks to this, I have learned my new 
master has a fetish for abandonment play.

05:00.570 --> 05:03.950
I don't have even an ounce 
of that fetish, okay?!

05:07.570 --> 05:10.160
I do feel bad about it!

05:10.160 --> 05:12.760
I just used Gate to return home out of habit.

05:12.760 --> 05:13.760
Huh.

05:13.760 --> 05:15.790
I think that's enough.

05:16.190 --> 05:18.440
He truly seems to regret it,

05:18.440 --> 05:21.750
and if you're too persistent, 
he really will abandon you.

05:22.260 --> 05:25.010
That would be unpleasant.

05:25.010 --> 05:31.020
Then I'll forgive you if you buy me 
naughty underwear that's to your liking.

05:31.020 --> 05:32.350
That's a huge hurdle!

05:32.350 --> 05:34.130
Even normal ones would be impossible!

05:34.130 --> 05:35.360
I jest.

05:41.720 --> 05:42.510
Jeez...

05:42.510 --> 05:45.680
Those thought circuits of 
hers really are incredible.

05:45.680 --> 05:47.600
How is that perverted mind incredible?

05:47.600 --> 05:51.930
It's her ability to pout, and the 
flexibility needed to tell jokes.

05:51.930 --> 05:53.910
She's like a real person.

05:53.910 --> 05:57.400
I wonder if it's even possible to 
reach that point with Program.

06:02.260 --> 06:04.300
So, what did you want today?

06:05.480 --> 06:08.200
To talk about the teleportation circles 
to the remaining Babylons.

06:08.200 --> 06:11.510
At the moment, we don't have 
any definite information.

06:11.510 --> 06:13.350
Huh? You plan to search for them?

06:13.350 --> 06:15.330
Huh? You <i>don't</i> plan to search for them?

06:15.330 --> 06:19.540
To be honest, I can't think 
of a reason to look for them.

06:19.540 --> 06:20.770
Why not?!

06:20.770 --> 06:24.870
Don't you want to know more about 
ancient knowledge or lost technology?

06:24.870 --> 06:26.700
I don't.

06:26.700 --> 06:31.530
Professor Babylon even said that this era 
doesn't need power that's too strong.

06:31.530 --> 06:33.740
You're a young man with no dreams!

06:33.740 --> 06:38.330
Well, I'll think about it once you have 
information on a teleportation circle.

06:38.330 --> 06:40.960
If you're sure we can find one, 
I'll help you with it.

06:40.960 --> 06:42.370
That's a promise.

06:42.370 --> 06:46.030
If you break it, you'll be buying naughty 
underwear for me, too, you hear?

06:46.030 --> 06:47.930
Please spare me that!

06:53.760 --> 06:56.970
Caller

06:53.760 --> 06:56.970
God

06:59.370 --> 07:00.540
Hup.

07:02.430 --> 07:05.190
Sorry for calling you here without notice.

07:06.650 --> 07:08.610
<b>God</b>

07:07.210 --> 07:10.530
I was just wondering how you were doing.

07:10.530 --> 07:12.300
How am I doing?

07:12.300 --> 07:13.950
There's nothing of particular note.

07:14.300 --> 07:18.160
Thanks to you, I'm living a 
rather fulfilling second life.

07:18.160 --> 07:22.960
Yes, well, I suppose there 
wouldn't be many special events

07:22.960 --> 07:27.020
that can top dying and getting 
resurrected in another world.

07:28.660 --> 07:31.370
Looks like your smartphone 
is working fine, too.

07:31.370 --> 07:32.450
Yes.

07:32.450 --> 07:34.340
It's been a big help to me.

07:34.840 --> 07:40.310
I still don't really know what 
I want to do in this world,

07:40.700 --> 07:44.510
but whatever I decide on will 
probably require money,

07:44.510 --> 07:48.280
so for now, I'll keep working on 
completing extermination quests.

07:48.280 --> 07:50.540
I see, I see.

07:51.340 --> 07:54.530
Why haffn'h you sheh your 
fianshées as your hhmm shreen?

07:54.530 --> 07:55.280
Huh?

07:55.280 --> 07:57.300
If I set my fiancées as my home screen,

07:57.300 --> 08:00.120
it would it be super 
embarrassing if I ever lost it!

08:00.120 --> 08:03.580
I'm surprised you could understand her.

08:04.870 --> 08:06.220
What's wrong with that?

08:06.220 --> 08:09.190
Laughing and blushing over having 
your loved ones as your home screen...

08:09.190 --> 08:12.300
That's one of the real 
pleasures of being in love!

08:12.680 --> 08:15.780
I don't really want to start 
laughing and blushing, though.

08:15.780 --> 08:17.060
I already know!

08:17.060 --> 08:19.920
You were doing it in town just the other day!

08:19.920 --> 08:22.520
That day that you bought 
those four engagement rings!

08:22.520 --> 08:25.620
No, I was just nervous that day,

08:25.620 --> 08:27.240
not really blushing and laughing...

08:27.240 --> 08:29.000
Wait, you were watching us?

08:29.000 --> 08:30.720
I saw it, too.

08:30.720 --> 08:31.740
You too, God?!

08:31.740 --> 08:36.310
I went ahead and made their fingers 
smooth when you put the rings on.

08:36.310 --> 08:38.640
That's why the rings went on so easily.

08:38.640 --> 08:39.830
Be grateful.

08:40.350 --> 08:43.070
You guys have too much time on your hands.

08:52.600 --> 08:55.460
This feels great.

09:07.910 --> 09:09.620
It makes you happy, doesn't it?

09:10.290 --> 09:12.070
I understand how you feel.

09:12.070 --> 09:14.920
I keep finding my eyes going to mine, as well...

09:14.920 --> 09:19.490
To the engagement ring Touya gave me.

09:19.490 --> 09:24.890
It really is enchanted with Accel, 
Transfer, and Storage, isn't it?

09:24.890 --> 09:28.170
They were a big help during 
today's extermination, too.

09:29.610 --> 09:31.380
That's true.

09:31.890 --> 09:34.340
Touya is an incredible person.

09:34.340 --> 09:38.220
You all realize that his 
power is exceptional, right?

09:39.250 --> 09:45.100
I imagine Touya will continue to use his 
power, without reserve, to save others.

09:45.100 --> 09:49.350
Though there might be those who 
seek to use his power for themselves.

09:49.350 --> 09:51.130
He is too soft-hearted.

09:51.130 --> 09:53.860
He's the type to be easily deceived.

09:54.770 --> 09:57.740
I'm not too worried about those types,

09:57.740 --> 10:00.220
since my mystic eyes will 
see right through them.

10:00.220 --> 10:03.330
The real problem is harm that 
comes from good intentions.

10:03.750 --> 10:06.040
What do you mean by that?

10:06.430 --> 10:07.700
For example,

10:07.700 --> 10:11.230
say there is a woman who loves Touya.

10:11.230 --> 10:16.250
Now what if the people around 
this woman wish to use Touya,

10:16.250 --> 10:19.280
and they impose an unreasonable 
demand upon her?

10:19.280 --> 10:23.550
And what if she were to ask Touya to 
help with that unreasonable demand?

10:24.220 --> 10:27.890
Even if it would mean risking harm to himself,

10:27.890 --> 10:30.690
Touya wouldn't be able to 
refuse her, would he?

10:31.480 --> 10:33.360
Now I see...

10:33.360 --> 10:35.020
What scares me the most

10:35.020 --> 10:38.900
is a woman like that achieving 
the same position as us.

10:38.900 --> 10:42.210
Becoming his fiancée, you mean?

10:42.210 --> 10:43.390
Yes.

10:43.390 --> 10:46.940
I'm sure there will be more 
who come to love Touya,

10:46.940 --> 10:49.570
and I'm sure he will come 
to have more fiancées.

10:49.570 --> 10:50.690
Huh?!

10:50.690 --> 10:54.630
However, let's support Touya with 
just the four of us for a while.

10:54.630 --> 10:57.950
True, he can be a little reckless at times.

10:57.950 --> 10:59.840
I-I'll do my best!

10:59.840 --> 11:03.800
To that end, we'll all need 
to grow stronger, as well.

11:04.340 --> 11:07.860
In order to share our lives with Touya!

11:10.520 --> 11:12.940
Thanks for the repeat business!

11:15.830 --> 11:17.900
So it'll be all finished a week from now, huh?

11:18.300 --> 11:21.150
I hope it turns out to be 
a nice mythril sword.

11:21.150 --> 11:24.240
Yes. You have my gratitude, Touya-dono.

11:24.790 --> 11:29.040
I wasn't able to be of much help 
during our last extermination.

11:29.040 --> 11:32.750
Hopefully, with this, I'll be able 
to give you proper support.

11:33.250 --> 11:34.800
Well, shall we head back?

11:42.150 --> 11:43.330
What's the matter?

11:43.330 --> 11:46.780
U-Um, well...

11:46.780 --> 11:51.840
I-I am your fiancée, right?

11:51.840 --> 11:52.740
Huh?

11:52.740 --> 11:55.140
Y-Yeah, you are.

11:57.340 --> 12:00.670
In that case, well...

12:00.670 --> 12:03.030
U-Um...

12:03.030 --> 12:07.410
I-I'd like to spend a little 
more time alone with you,

12:07.410 --> 12:14.330
a-a-and I'd like to hold hands 
as we walk, you know?

12:32.580 --> 12:38.470
I hope we can walk alongside each other 
like this for the rest of our lives.

12:38.470 --> 12:39.260
Yeah.

12:45.460 --> 12:46.660
Really?!

12:46.660 --> 12:48.990
You finally won over Touya?!

12:48.990 --> 12:51.150
This calls for celebration!

12:54.460 --> 12:59.220
Yumina, be sure to devote 
yourself to Touya even more

12:59.220 --> 13:01.430
and support him as his wife.

13:01.430 --> 13:02.920
Yes, Mother!

13:02.920 --> 13:06.620
It might be tough being 
married to four women,

13:06.620 --> 13:08.680
but do your best, all right?

13:08.680 --> 13:11.350
Well, I will marry them for sure,

13:11.350 --> 13:12.890
but not any time soon...

13:12.890 --> 13:16.850
At the very least, that's 
on hold until I turn 18.

13:18.260 --> 13:22.780
But I do want to see my grandchildren's 
faces as soon as possible!

13:22.780 --> 13:24.190
Don't wait to make ba—

13:25.330 --> 13:27.540
<i>She just used Accel, didn't she?</i>

13:27.540 --> 13:30.530
Father, you have no tact at all!

13:31.870 --> 13:33.970
My apologies.

13:33.970 --> 13:37.330
He just lost control because he's so happy.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.750
But what should we do, then?

13:40.330 --> 13:42.060
There might be all kinds of issues

13:42.060 --> 13:46.860
around formally announcing 
your engagement to Yumina.

13:46.860 --> 13:48.220
What do mean?

13:48.750 --> 13:52.430
For starters, the nobles 
who sought to wed Yumina

13:52.430 --> 13:54.720
will likely grow hostile toward you.

13:55.230 --> 13:58.640
On the other hand, there will also be 
those who come forth to curry your favor.

13:59.600 --> 14:02.170
There will probably be stubborn fools

14:02.170 --> 14:04.370
who refuse to acknowledge 
you as worthy of Yumina

14:04.370 --> 14:06.570
without some accomplishment 
to prove yourself.

14:07.010 --> 14:08.770
I see...

14:08.770 --> 14:11.030
Is your discussion over yet?

14:13.290 --> 14:15.870
Yes. Come on over here.

14:17.890 --> 14:19.690
It's been a while.

14:20.540 --> 14:23.240
Hello, Big Sis Yumina.

14:23.240 --> 14:25.350
You too, Touya. Have you been well?

14:25.350 --> 14:26.870
Yeah. And you, Sue?

14:26.870 --> 14:28.470
Of course I have!

14:37.770 --> 14:38.890
Hey...

14:38.890 --> 14:43.610
Will my engagement to you 
make me king, by any chance?

14:44.020 --> 14:48.450
As things stand now, 
that's the most likely outcome.

14:48.450 --> 14:52.940
If I get a younger brother  
or my uncle has a male child,

14:52.940 --> 14:54.830
it might end up differently.

14:54.830 --> 14:58.890
But they agreed to delay the 
formal announcement for a while,

14:58.890 --> 15:03.340
so I don't think you need to think 
about being king and such yet.

15:03.340 --> 15:06.460
That's true. It's just...

15:07.180 --> 15:10.310
<i>It sounds like it would be 
good to get an early start</i>

15:10.310 --> 15:13.800
<i>on working toward that accomplishment 
the queen mentioned.</i>

15:14.250 --> 15:16.300
<i>An accomplishment, huh?</i>

15:16.300 --> 15:20.460
<i>I suppose she means doing something that 
would be of great benefit to the nation?</i>

15:22.460 --> 15:24.520
How's business lately?

15:25.720 --> 15:27.350
It's bad.

15:27.350 --> 15:30.360
We're definitely seeing 
fewer customers than before.

15:30.360 --> 15:32.320
I see...

15:33.970 --> 15:39.910
It's because there's not really any special 
product or sightseeing spot in this city.

15:42.180 --> 15:45.730
<i>An inn needs customers to spend the 
night there in order to make a profit.</i>

15:45.730 --> 15:47.380
<i>A temporary fix won't work.</i>

15:47.810 --> 15:50.980
<i>They need something that 
can only be found here,</i>

15:50.980 --> 15:53.000
<i>that makes people want 
to stay here for a while.</i>

15:58.460 --> 15:59.610
I can make it.

16:00.500 --> 16:02.580
Do this here, do that there...

16:02.580 --> 16:04.980
Do this to that, then this, 
this, this, this, this!

16:03.900 --> 16:04.980
<b>Men</b>

16:07.980 --> 16:09.190
Men                  Women

16:12.370 --> 16:13.410
It's a hot spring.

16:13.890 --> 16:16.390
I'll lend this to the Silver Moon indefinitely.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.470
A bath is a big luxury!

16:19.470 --> 16:22.490
If we let people in for cheap, 
they'll all be overjoyed!

16:22.490 --> 16:23.390
Yeah!

16:23.390 --> 16:25.790
They'll be sure to stay at our inn, too!

16:25.790 --> 16:28.060
We're about to get busy now!

16:28.460 --> 16:32.170
Let me contact some people I know, 
and we'll give it a test run.

16:32.550 --> 16:34.380
<b>Men</b>

16:41.980 --> 16:45.480
There are a lot of old men in the men's bath.

16:45.480 --> 16:47.310
<b>Women</b>

16:54.090 --> 16:55.990
Touya's amazing, isn't he?

16:55.990 --> 17:00.520
He built this incredible 
hot spring in no time.

17:01.180 --> 17:02.950
Back pain, stiff shoulders...

17:03.990 --> 17:06.650
It's even effective against 
the aftereffects of poison?

17:06.650 --> 17:08.260
Oh, look, look!

17:08.260 --> 17:10.410
It says it makes your skin smoother, too!

17:10.410 --> 17:11.210
Really?

17:12.680 --> 17:16.910
You can't wait to show Touya 
your sparkling clear skin

17:16.910 --> 17:18.180
after soaking a while, can you?

17:18.180 --> 17:19.350
Huh?!

17:19.350 --> 17:24.030
I-I wasn't thinking about 
showing off for Touya!

17:24.030 --> 17:25.620
M-M-Me, neither!

17:25.620 --> 17:26.640
Nor was I!

17:26.640 --> 17:29.380
Why are you all trying to deny it?

17:29.380 --> 17:30.980
You all love Touya, don't you?

17:32.310 --> 17:37.620
Or did you become Touya's fiancée 
with half-hearted sentiments?

17:37.620 --> 17:38.380
Tha—

17:38.380 --> 17:39.690
That's not true at all!

17:39.690 --> 17:43.630
My feelings for Touya-dono 
are as sincere as can be!

17:43.950 --> 17:48.250
Then please tell me about when 
you fell in love with Touya.

17:48.250 --> 17:49.420
Huh?

17:49.420 --> 17:50.420
Elze?

17:50.420 --> 17:51.800
H-Huh?

17:51.800 --> 17:53.000
Me first?

17:53.000 --> 17:54.960
Yes, please!

18:02.590 --> 18:04.370
Uh...

18:04.370 --> 18:08.530
Ever since I first met Touya,

18:08.530 --> 18:11.900
he's always seen me as a woman.

18:12.520 --> 18:16.180
When he bought me clothes, 
he said I looked good in them.

18:16.180 --> 18:18.240
Every time I recalled moments like that,

18:18.570 --> 18:21.040
I found myself grinning.

18:21.740 --> 18:22.700
But...

18:23.020 --> 18:25.950
Oddly enough, it didn't feel bad, right?

18:27.820 --> 18:30.490
Then, little by little, 
I grew interested in him,

18:30.490 --> 18:35.130
and before I knew it, I realized 
my eyes were always following him.

18:36.880 --> 18:39.430
I-I can't go on! No more!

18:41.020 --> 18:46.270
So you tried to hide your love for Touya 
and remain just his comrade,

18:46.270 --> 18:49.020
because you thought you could 
remain by his side forever that way.

18:49.020 --> 18:51.720
Hey! How did you know that?!

18:51.720 --> 18:53.450
It's not that I knew.

18:53.450 --> 18:54.730
Just that I could tell.

18:56.010 --> 18:57.240
Next is...

19:03.250 --> 19:05.480
I-I really...

19:05.480 --> 19:07.340
Tell us!

19:09.870 --> 19:12.510
Yes!

19:15.250 --> 19:20.380
I-I always had difficulty talking to men.

19:20.380 --> 19:23.470
I always made them irritated with me.

19:24.370 --> 19:27.560
But Touya was different.

19:27.980 --> 19:31.100
When he asked me to teach him magic,

19:31.100 --> 19:34.170
I ended up giving him 
a faltering explanation,

19:34.170 --> 19:39.280
but he never got angry, and he 
listened to me with his full attention.

19:39.720 --> 19:42.300
So before I knew it,

19:42.300 --> 19:46.860
I was able to interact normally 
with Touya as his friend.

19:48.100 --> 19:51.830
But then, one day, I felt a sting in my chest.

19:51.830 --> 19:54.810
That was the day Touya brought 
me into the picture, right?

19:54.810 --> 19:57.640
Huh?! H-How did you know?!

19:57.640 --> 19:59.190
It's not that I knew.

19:59.190 --> 20:00.300
Just that I could tell.

20:01.870 --> 20:07.060
That was probably when I realized 
that I had feelings for Touya.

20:09.080 --> 20:11.050
Now, that leaves...

20:11.050 --> 20:13.560
M-Me, right?

20:15.910 --> 20:20.820
I... had realized Touya-dono's true nature.

20:20.820 --> 20:22.090
True nature?

20:23.280 --> 20:27.030
It's hard to say that Touya-dono looks strong,

20:27.030 --> 20:29.790
yet he has the strength of heart
to stand up and fight

20:29.790 --> 20:35.010
for the things he wants to 
protect, without hesitation.

20:35.010 --> 20:38.020
He acts for the sake of 
others more than himself,

20:38.020 --> 20:40.540
and he believes that reaching 
out to help those in need

20:40.540 --> 20:42.710
is the natural thing to do.

20:43.260 --> 20:45.500
Yes, Touya is...

20:45.500 --> 20:47.220
Yeah, that's how he is!

20:47.220 --> 20:51.060
That's why we all fell in love with him.

20:52.580 --> 20:56.560
H-Hey, it's not fair that 
you've only made us share!

20:56.560 --> 20:58.270
You tell us too, Yumina!

20:58.270 --> 20:59.060
Huh?

20:59.650 --> 21:03.980
For me... It's as I said once before.

21:03.980 --> 21:09.370
The moment I first saw Touya, 
I knew he was the man for me.

21:09.370 --> 21:11.190
Whether that was thanks to my mystic eyes,

21:11.190 --> 21:14.200
simple love at first sight, or 
some calculation, I do not know.

21:14.950 --> 21:18.710
But I fell in love with him.

21:18.710 --> 21:21.380
Y-Yeah, you did mention that.

21:21.380 --> 21:23.050
Yeah, that's why...

21:23.050 --> 21:26.890
You went to confirm it was 
definitely love at first sight.

21:28.970 --> 21:31.740
Master, shall I wash your back?

21:32.470 --> 21:33.950
You need not worry.

21:33.950 --> 21:36.940
A mysterious steam will conceal everything.

21:38.150 --> 21:40.980
Stop being ridiculous and 
just soak quietly in your bath!

21:41.300 --> 21:43.910
Now, now, no need to hold back.

21:50.510 --> 21:53.700
Good thing I enchanted the top 
of the fence with Paralyze.

21:55.300 --> 21:59.460
Anyone trying to climb the fence to 
sneak a peek will pay for it like that,

21:59.460 --> 22:00.980
so please be careful.

22:05.620 --> 22:07.660
The water's great.

22:09.300 --> 22:11.140
Touya! I found one!

22:11.140 --> 22:12.850
A ruin of Babylon!

22:14.660 --> 22:15.460
Huh?

22:17.370 --> 22:19.350
What?
